<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<style>
  @page {
    size: A4 portrait;
    margin: 15mm 18mm;
  }
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  html, body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  body {
    font-family: "Georgia", "Times New Roman", serif;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
    print-color-adjust: exact;
  }
  .top-line {
    border-top: 3px solid #2F5D62;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  h1 {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }
  .date-line {
    text-align: right;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #444;
  }
  p {
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    text-align: justify;
  }
  .recipient {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .recipient .name {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .signature {
    margin-top: 36px;
    break-inside: avoid;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .signature p {
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .signature .name {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .company-name {
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #2F5D62;
  }
  .details-box {
    background: #f6f8f8;
    border-left: 3px solid #2F5D62;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    margin: 16px 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    break-inside: avoid;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .details-box .row {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .details-box .row:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .details-box .row .label {
    width: 140px;
    color: #555;
  }
  .details-box .row .value {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="top-line"></div>

<h1>JOINING LETTER</h1>

<div class="date-line">
  Date: {{letterDate}}
</div>

<div class="recipient">
  <div>To,</div>
  <div>The HR Manager,</div>
  <div class="company-name">{{companyName}}</div>
  <div>{{companyAddress}}</div>
</div>

<p>Dear <span class="name">{{employeeName}}</span>,</p>

<p>
  This is to formally confirm that you have joined <span class="company-name">{{companyName}}</span>
  on <strong>{{dateOfJoining}}</strong> as a <strong>{{designation}}</strong>
  in the <strong>{{department}}</strong> department.
</p>

<div class="details-box">
  <div class="row"><div class="label">Employee Code:</div><div class="value">{{employeeCode}}</div></div>
  <div class="row"><div class="label">Full Name:</div><div class="value">{{employeeName}}</div></div>
  <div class="row"><div class="label">Father's Name:</div><div class="value">{{fatherName}}</div></div>
  <div class="row"><div class="label">Category:</div><div class="value">{{category}}</div></div>
  <div class="row"><div class="label">Department:</div><div class="value">{{department}}</div></div>
  <div class="row"><div class="label">Designation:</div><div class="value">{{designation}}</div></div>
  <div class="row"><div class="label">Employment Type:</div><div class="value">{{employmentType}}</div></div>
  <div class="row"><div class="label">Date of Joining:</div><div class="value">{{dateOfJoining}}</div></div>
</div>

<p>
  We welcome you to our team and look forward to a long and mutually beneficial
  association. Please feel free to reach out to the HR department for any
  assistance you may need during your onboarding.
</p>

<p>
  We wish you all the very best in your new role.
</p>

<div class="signature">
  <p>Warm regards,</p>
  <div class="name">{{companyName}}</div>
  <div>Authorised Signatory</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>